<%- include('../partials/header') %> <%- include('../partials/page-heading', { eyebrow: 'A LITTLE PERSPECTIVE', description: 'Understand where your classrooms are filling up and where there’s room to grow.' }) %>
<div class="stats-grid compact">
  <% [['Total capacity','140'],['Enrolled seats','117'],['Available seats','23']].forEach(([label,value]) => { %>
  <article class="stat-card">
    <span><%= label %></span><strong><%= value %></strong
    ><small>Illustrative section totals</small>
  </article>
  <% }) %>
</div>
<div class="content-split">
  <section class="panel">
    <div class="panel-heading">
      <h2>Enrollment by section</h2>
      <span class="badge"><%= term %></span>
    </div>
    <% sections.forEach(s => { %>
    <div class="report-row">
      <div class="row-between">
        <strong><%= s.course.code %> · <%= s.sectionCode %></strong
        ><span><%= s.enrolledCount %> / <%= s.capacity %></span>
      </div>
      <meter
        min="0"
        max="<%= s.capacity %>"
        value="<%= s.enrolledCount %>"
        aria-label="<%= s.course.code %> seat occupancy"
      ></meter
      ><small class="muted"
        ><%= s.capacity - s.enrolledCount %> seats remaining</small
      >
    </div>
    <% }) %>
  </section>
  <aside class="panel">
    <span class="eyebrow">THE BIG PICTURE</span>
    <h2>Room to grow.</h2>
    <p class="muted">
      Seat utilization across the sample sections is 84%. One section is full.
    </p>
    <div class="notice">
      Sample totals represent seat enrollments, rather than unique students.
    </div>
    <a href="/admin/sections" class="text-link">Review section capacity ↗</a>
  </aside>
</div>
<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
